            "content": "s = \"C@qpl==Bppl@<=pG<>@l>@Blsp<@l@AArqmGr=B@A>q@@B=GEsmC@ArBmAGlA=@q\"\ns1 = []\n\nfor x in s:\n    s1.append(ord(x)^3)\n\ns2= \"\"\n\nfor x in range(len(s)):\n    s2 += chr(s1[len(s1)-1-x]-13)\nprint(repr(s2))",
